lid.176.ftz is the compressed language identification model of fastText,
https://fasttext.cc/docs/en/language-identification.html
It is distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-Share-Alike
License 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/
It is used unchanged, to detect the language of a text before the offline
translation.
Reference: A. Joulin, E. Grave, P. Bojanowski, T. Mikolov, Bag of Tricks for
Efficient Text Classification.
